<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Supplier negotiation emails</h1><p>Emails to suppliers built from what your records show, with each fact linked to its evidence.</p></div></div>
<% const label={late:'Late deliveries',short:'Short deliveries',price:'Price increases',quote:'Cheaper quotes',volume:'What we buy'}; %>
<% if(shadow){ %><p class="notice">The first 14 days are Watch only. Drafting and sending wait until that period ends.</p><% } %>
<% if(saved){ const facts=saved.facts||[]; %><section class="card section"><h2><%= saved.kind==='lead_time_check'?'Lead-time note':'Negotiation email' %> to <%= saved.supplier_name %></h2>
<p><%= saved.status==='PREPARED'?'Unsent draft':saved.status==='SENT'?'Sent '+helpers.dateTime(saved.sent_at):saved.status==='FAILED'?'Not sent: '+(saved.error_message||'needs review'):'Queued for sending' %><%= saved.automatic?' · prepared by your supplier rule':'' %> · facts from <%= saved.from_day %> to <%= saved.to_day %>.</p>
<% if(saved.needs_person&&saved.status==='PREPARED'){ %><p class="notice"><%= saved.needs_person %></p><% } %>
<% for(const f of facts){ %><article class="section"><h3><%= label[f.kind]||f.kind %></h3><p><%= f.text %></p><ul><% for(const e of f.evidence){ %><li><a href="<%= e.href %>"><%= e.label %></a></li><% } %></ul></article><% } %>
<% if(saved.status==='PREPARED'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-negotiations/drafts/<%= saved.id %>/save" class="form-stack section"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Subject</span><input name="subject" maxlength="200" required value="<%= saved.subject %>"></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Email</span><textarea name="body" rows="14" maxlength="20000" required><%= saved.body %></textarea></label>
<button class="btn">Save changes</button></form>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-negotiations/drafts/<%= saved.id %>/send" class="form-stack section"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="bodyHash" value="<%= bodyHash %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Send from</span><select name="connectorId" required><option value="">Choose a connected mailbox</option><% for(const box of mailboxes){ %><option value="<%= box.id %>"><%= box.display_name %></option><% } %></select></label>
<% if(!saved.supplier_email){ %><p class="notice">Add <%= saved.supplier_name %>’s email address before sending.</p><% } %>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Send this email to <%= saved.supplier_email||saved.supplier_name %> as it is saved above.</label>
<button class="btn btn--primary" <%= shadow||!mailboxes.length||!saved.supplier_email?'disabled':'' %>>Send to supplier</button></form><% }else{ %><div class="quiet-note"><p><strong><%= saved.subject %></strong></p><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:inherit"><%= saved.body %></pre></div><% } %>
<p><a href="/autopilot/supplier-negotiations?supplier=<%= encodeURIComponent(saved.supplier_id) %>">Back to <%= saved.supplier_name %></a></p></section><% }else{ %>
<section class="card section"><form method="get" action="/autopilot/supplier-negotiations" class="form-stack"><label class="rm-field"><span>Supplier</span><select name="supplier" required><option value="">Choose a supplier</option><% for(const s of suppliers){ %><option value="<%= s.id %>" <%= s.id===supplierId?'selected':'' %>><%= s.name %></option><% } %></select></label><button class="btn">Show what the records say</button></form></section>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(found){ %><section class="card section"><h2><%= found.supplier.name %></h2><p>From <%= found.from %> to <%= found.to %>.</p>
<% if(!found.facts.length){ %><p>Nothing recorded to negotiate with yet: no late or short deliveries, price increases, cheaper quotes or orders in this period.</p><% } %>
<% for(const f of found.facts){ %><article class="section"><h3><%= label[f.kind]||f.kind %></h3><p><%= f.text %></p><ul><% for(const e of f.evidence.slice(0,20)){ %><li><a href="<%= e.href %>"><%= e.label %></a></li><% } %></ul><% if(f.evidence.length>20){ %><p>And <%= f.evidence.length-20 %> more.</p><% } %></article><% } %>
<% if(key){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/negotiation-draft" class="form-stack section"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="supplier" value="<%= found.supplier.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="evidence" value="<%= key %>"><button class="btn btn--primary" <%= shadow?'disabled':'' %>>Draft an email from these facts</button><p>You can change the email before it goes out. Nothing is sent until you press Send.</p></form><% } %></section>
<section class="card section"><h2>Routine lead-time note</h2>
<% if(mode!=='trained'){ %><p>On Custom, StockChief can send <%= found.supplier.name %> a short “please confirm your lead times” note on its own when deliveries were late. It never changes prices or orders. <a href="/settings/billing">See plans</a></p>
<% }else if(rule){ %><p>On. Every <%= rule.every_days %> days, if deliveries were late, StockChief <%= rule.connector_id?'sends':'prepares' %> a note asking <%= found.supplier.name %> to confirm the lead time they can meet.<%= rule.last_note?' Last check: '+rule.last_note:'' %></p>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/negotiation-rule" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="supplier" value="<%= found.supplier.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= rule.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="remove" value="1"><button class="btn">Stop the routine note</button></form>
<% }else if(key){ %><p>Until you teach it, StockChief only drafts. Teach it to send <%= found.supplier.name %> a short note asking them to confirm the lead time they can meet whenever deliveries were late. It never changes prices or orders.</p>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/negotiation-rule" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="supplier" value="<%= found.supplier.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="evidence" value="<%= key %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="">
<label class="rm-field"><span>How often (days)</span><input name="everyDays" type="number" min="30" max="365" value="90" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Send from</span><select name="connectorId"><option value="">Only prepare it for me</option><% for(const box of mailboxes){ %><option value="<%= box.id %>"><%= box.display_name %></option><% } %></select></label>
<button class="btn">Teach the routine note</button></form><% }else{ %><p>Teach a routine note once there are facts for this supplier.</p><% } %></section><% } %><% } %>
<% if(recent.length){ %><section class="card section"><h2>Emails</h2><% for(const r of recent){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/supplier-negotiations/drafts/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.subject %></a> · <%= r.supplier_name %> · <%= r.status==='PREPARED'?(r.needs_person?'Needs you':'Draft'):r.status==='SENT'?'Sent':r.status==='FAILED'?'Not sent':'Queued' %> · <%= helpers.dateTime(r.created_at) %></p><% } %></section><% } %>
